 "wikipedia": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puddle_of_Mudd",
 "resumo_pt": "Puddle of Mudd é uma banda norte-americana de rock alternativo/post-grunge formada em 1993. Entre suas influências musicais incluem-se Alice in Chains e Nirvana.",
 "resumo_en": "Puddle of Mudd is an American rock band formed in Kansas City, Missouri in 1992. Their second album, Come Clean (2001), spawned the single \"Blurry\", which peaked at number 5 on the Billboard Hot 100, and remains their signature song. The album sold over five million copies by 2003, and was followed by seven additional albums, the latest of which is Kiss the Machine (2025). Vocalist and guitarist Wes Scantlin has served as the only consistent member throughout the band's history.",
