   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Welcome_to_Galvania",
   "resumo_en": "Welcome to Galvania is the seventh studio album by the American rock band Puddle of Mudd. Released on September 13, 2019 via Pavement Entertainment, it marked the band's first new studio album of original songs in ten years, the last being 2009's Volume 4: Songs in the Key of Love & Hate and is their first full-length release since 2011's cover album Re:(disc)overed, marking the longest gap between albums releases in the band's existence.\nLoudwire named it one of the 50 best rock albums of 2019."
